---
description: Kaal privacy and CLI guidance
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` before operating Kaal or its vault.

Use `$HOME/.local/bin/kaal` explicitly when `kaal` is unavailable on `PATH`.
Never print vault bodies, OCR text, medical data, tax data, attachment names, or
Keychain material unless the user explicitly asks to disclose it. Keep medical
receipts in `kaal medical …`; do not use generic note commands for them.
